# FasterCapital

> FasterCapital publishes English founder articles, a business-term glossary, multilingual blogs, and keyword/topic digests for startups and operators.

This file lists the main public libraries. Use the sitemap indexes for the full URL set.

## Articles

English-only how-to articles. Each article URL is `/articles/{slug}--{id}.html`.

- [Article index](https://fastercapital.com/article-index/): browse articles by topic
- Example: [How to Achieve Content Marketing Differentiation](https://fastercapital.com/articles/how-to-achieve-content-marketing-differentiation--1.html)

## Terms

Glossary pages at `/term/{term}.html` (English) with selected translations under language-specific term paths.

- Example: [Startup](https://fastercapital.com/term/startup.html)

## Content / blogs

Long-form blogs at `/content/{File-Name}.html`, with translations such as `/fr/contenu/`, `/de/inhalt/`, `/es/contenido/`, `/it/contenuto/`, `/pt/contente/`, `/nl/inhoud/`, `/arabpreneur/`, `/cn/content/`, `/ja/content/`, `/ko/content/`, `/hi/content/`, `/ru/content/`.

- Example: [Designing Impactful Launch Campaigns for Your Startup](https://fastercapital.com/content/Designing-Impactful-Launch-Campaigns-for-Your-Startup.html)

## Keywords

Digest pages that group blog sections around a keyword. English URLs are `/keyword/{slug}.html`; other languages use localized paths (`/fr/mots-cle/`, `/de/keyword/`, `/es/palabra-clave/`, `/it/parola-chiave/`, `/pt/palavra-chave/`, `/nl/trefwoord/`, `/kalimat/`).

- [Keyword index](https://fastercapital.com/keyword-index/)
- Example: [Lean Startup](https://fastercapital.com/keyword/lean-startup.html)

## Topics

Topic digests at `/topics/{slug}.html`, with localized paths (`/fr/sujet/`, `/de/thema/`, `/es/tema/`, `/it/tema/`, `/pt/tema/`, `/nl/tema/`, `/siyaq/`). Topic slugs are language-specific.

- [Topic index](https://fastercapital.com/startup-topic/index.html)
- Example: [How startup valuations work (FR)](https://fastercapital.com/fr/sujet/comment-fonctionnent-les-évaluations-de-startups.html)

## Questions

Entrepreneur Q&A hubs at `/questions/{slug}.html` (and localized `/fr/questions-entrepreneurs/`, `/de/unternehmer-fragen/`, `/as3ela/`, and the other language prefixes).

- Example: [What is a startup?](https://fastercapital.com/questions/what-is-a-startup.html)

